    "title": "HVAC Services in North Jersey | Fred's Climate Control",
    "lang": "en",
    "metaDescription": "Heating, AC, boilers, mini splits and rooftop units in Hudson, Bergen, Passaic & Essex County, NJ. Licensed & insured, 20+ years, free estimates. Call 973-393-8027.",
